# Per-shard DMARC report poller. Runs every 30 min. Each tick:
#   1) reads infra_shards (status IN active,verified) from Supabase
#   2) opens IMAP at dmarc@<sub>.<root> on each shard's mail VPS
#   3) parses aggregate + forensic reports via parsedmarc
#   4) upserts structured rows into dmarc_aggregate_reports / _records /
#      _forensic_reports; logs the cron tick into dmarc_ingest_runs
*/30 * * * * /usr/local/bin/python /app/dmarc/dmarc_poll.py
